  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:380px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-goldenrod pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Aura Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/6d/Nagato_%28Naruto%29_Gakido.gif/revision/latest?cb=20181128065106\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Nagato (Naruto) Gakido\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/6d/Nagato_%28Naruto%29_Gakido.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20181128065106\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/6d/Nagato_%28Naruto%29_Gakido.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20181128065106 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/6d/Nagato_%28Naruto%29_Gakido.gif/revision/latest?cb=20181128065106 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Nagato (Naruto) Gakido\" width=\"270\" height=\"151\" data-image-key=\"Nagato_%28Naruto%29_Gakido.gif\" data-image-name=\"Nagato (Naruto) Gakido.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Nagato (Naruto) using the Blocking Technique Absorption Seal to absorb chakra from a technique via the Gakido/Preta Path.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb auras.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The ability to <b>absorb auras and utilize it in some way</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Aura_Manipulation\" title=\"Aura Manipulation\">Aura Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAura_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb auras, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p><p>By absorbing auras, user can also absorb all of the power that the target aura possesses, including its spiritual essence, allowing a form of <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAura_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cultivation\" title=\"Cultivation\">Cultivation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Emotion_Absorption\" title=\"Emotion Absorption\">Emotion Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Drain\" title=\"Energy Drain\">Energy Drain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Absorption\" title=\"Knowledge Absorption\">Knowledge Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Memory_Absorption\" title=\"Memory Absorption\">Memory Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personality_Absorption\" title=\"Personality Absorption\">Personality Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Mixture\" title=\"Power Mixture\">Power Mixture</a> by combining absorbed powers.</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAura_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_Manipulation\" title=\"Aura Manipulation\">Aura Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_Reading\" title=\"Aura Reading\">Aura Reading</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAura_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>May gain some of the victim's personality.\n<ul><li>May be overtaken by target's emotions.</li></ul></li>\n<li>May be involuntary.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAura_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Yuki Terumi's Nox Nyctores: Ouroboros (<i>BlazBlue</i>)</li>\n<li>Succubi and Incubi (<i>Folklore/Mythology</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dragonschef.fandom.com/wiki/Javier_Asrahan\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:the-greatest-estate-developer:Javier Asrahan\">Javier Asrahan</a> (<i>The Greatest Estate Developer</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://dragonschef.fandom.com/wiki/Lloyd_Frontera\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:the-greatest-estate-developer:Lloyd Frontera\">Kim Suho/Lloyd Frontera</a> (<i>The Greatest Estate Developer</i>)</li>\n<li>Linda Tavara (<i>Heroes</i>)</li>\n<li>Genshirou Saji (<i>Highschool DxD</i>); via Absorbtion Line/Virtra Sacred Gears</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hunterxhunter.fandom.com/wiki/Meruem\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:hunterxhunter:Meruem\">Meruem</a> (<i>Hunter x Hunter</i>)</li>\n<li>Users of <a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Chakra_Absorption_Techniques\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Chakra Absorption Techniques\">Chakra Absorption Techniques</a> (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/Delta\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Delta\">Delta</a> (<i>Boruto</i>); via modified eyes</li>\n<li>Gillian Asturias (<i>RWBY: Before the Dawn</i>)</li>\n<li>Aloysius Kallig (<i>Star Wars: The Old Republic</i>)</li>\n<li>Evil Dragon (<i>Teen Titans Go!</i>)</li>\n<li>Yin (<i>Yin Yang Yo!</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAura_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"a4bbbfeafeff9d8cd580e384054ac361\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gall